{%- comment -%}
  Rosalia · Funnel behaviour loader
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Only two sections need JavaScript at all:

    rosalia-funnel-sticky-cta  — show/hide the bar
    rosalia-funnel-timeline    — write the live dates

  So only those two render this. Every other funnel section ships with
  no script of its own, which keeps a long advertorial down to a single
  <script> tag instead of one per section.

  If both sections are on the same page the tag appears twice; the file
  guards itself with window.__rosaliaFunnelBooted, so the second one is
  a no-op rather than a second set of listeners.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'rosalia-funnel.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
